### ====================================================================
### WiseUp Backend API – HTTP Client Requests (IntelliJ / VS Code REST Client)
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = ana@wiseup.test
@password = segredo123

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. HEALTH
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### Liveness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTHENTICATION
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### Guest session (no account, no body) – captures token into @guestToken
# @name guest
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/guest
Accept: application/json

### Store the guest token
@guestToken = {{guest.response.body.token}}

### Login (captures token into @authToken variable)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "captchaToken": ""
}

### Store token dynamically from response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Get current session user (/auth/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Accept Gate (Adult self-declaration + Terms acceptance)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Delete Account (LGPD erasure)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json


### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. CATALOGUE (Requires valid session + adult verified + terms accepted)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Home Sections (Featured, Top10, rows)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/home
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List / Search Videos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/videos?q=&category=&ordering=mostviewed&period=weekly&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Video Detail by ID
@videoId = ph634f1e469e8b7
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/videos/{{videoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json


### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. MODERATION & REPORTS
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Report Reasons
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/reasons
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Submit a Report (Reasons: menor | sem_consentimento | violencia | direitos_autorais | outro)
# @name createReport
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "videoId": "{{videoId}}",
  "reason": "menor",
  "note": "Denúncia de teste via HTTP Client"
}

@reportId = {{createReport.response.body.id}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. ADMIN MODERATION (Requires user with is_admin = true)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

@adminToken = {{authToken}}

### Admin: List Open Reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/open
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Admin: List Blocked Videos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/blocked
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Admin: Review Report (procede: true = keep/block video; false = unblock if single report)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "procede": true
}

### Admin: Direct Manual Block (no report needed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/block
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "videoId": "{{videoId}}"
}
